WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.088 --> 00:00:01.447
- This is the "Turn Up" sandwich.

00:00:01.447 --> 00:00:03.455
Like Little Jon, when he
wrote "Turn Down for What",

00:00:03.455 --> 00:00:05.998
he wrote it based off of this
sandwich, this looks good.

00:00:05.998 --> 00:00:07.415
(slow bass music)

00:00:17.004 --> 00:00:18.815
I've never heard of Fat Sandwiches before.

00:00:18.815 --> 00:00:20.580
- Sounds like the best sandwich ever.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:22.054
- Better be stacked.

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:22.888
- Right?

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:24.109
- I feel like it's one
of those sandwiches,

00:00:24.109 --> 00:00:25.899
where you should not
eat it like in public.

00:00:25.899 --> 00:00:29.266
- I had some Pepto-Bismol
before this to prep my stomach.

00:00:29.266 --> 00:00:30.346
- Smells like bread.

00:00:30.346 --> 00:00:31.867
- Oh, shit, I lost a fry already.

00:00:31.867 --> 00:00:33.132
- It's like the bread's breaking.

00:00:33.132 --> 00:00:34.038
It can't handle the sandwich.

00:00:34.038 --> 00:00:35.187
- They've put all the good things

00:00:35.187 --> 00:00:36.581
in the world into one sandwich.

00:00:36.581 --> 00:00:38.833
- Are students at Rutgers fatter than

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:40.772
the average university student?

00:00:40.772 --> 00:00:42.502
- No, but they are drunker.

00:00:42.502 --> 00:00:43.976
- Oh, they're drunker.

00:00:43.976 --> 00:00:45.404
Oh, then this makes sense!

00:00:45.404 --> 00:00:48.330
- I wanna be drunker,
is what I kinda want.

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.804
I would like to be drunker.

00:00:49.804 --> 00:00:51.232
- This is so good.

00:00:51.232 --> 00:00:52.579
- This is missing cheese.

00:00:52.579 --> 00:00:54.472
- It is missing cheese.

00:00:54.472 --> 00:00:55.865
- There's a mozzarella stick!

00:00:55.865 --> 00:00:57.177
- There was a mozzarella stick in there?

00:00:57.177 --> 00:00:58.744
- Disguised as chicken.

00:00:58.744 --> 00:01:00.671
- Did we just like, inhale it and miss it?

00:01:00.671 --> 00:01:01.658
- It needs more sauce.

00:01:01.658 --> 00:01:02.761
- It really needs more sauce.

00:01:02.761 --> 00:01:04.189
- I'm already full.

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:06.732
- Thank God you had that
marinara sauce with you.

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:08.450
- I mean, I don't go anywhere without it.

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:09.727
- If a friend wants to have heartburn

00:01:09.727 --> 00:01:10.993
for the next seven or eight hours,

00:01:10.993 --> 00:01:12.595
I would definitely recommend this.

00:01:12.595 --> 00:01:14.476
- I ate everything, I don't
know where it even went.

00:01:14.476 --> 00:01:16.298
- Ten out of ten, would eat again.

00:01:16.298 --> 00:01:18.190
- It changed my life.

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:19.467
Forever.

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:21.333
- I ate it, I liked it, but that's

00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:22.924
gonna give me a heart attack.

00:01:22.924 --> 00:01:24.561
- It deserves the name "Fat Sandwich".

00:01:24.561 --> 00:01:26.697
- It's a private affair, it's
a personal private affair.

00:01:26.697 --> 00:01:31.121
- I made love to my sandwich,
like, yes, it was everything.

00:01:31.121 --> 00:01:34.787
Like, I'm thinkin' about
how good it tastes.

